## Workflow

1. `./tools/extract.sh` — extract cli.js + native modules from upstream claude binary into `dist/<arch>/`
2. Edit `tools/pipeline/patches.json` — define your patches (anchor on invariant content, never on minified names)
3. `./tools/build.sh` — apply patches + bun build → patched binary at `dist/<arch>/claude`
4. `./tools/run.sh [args]` — exec the patched binary

## Patches

Patches live in `tools/pipeline/patches.json`. Big patch bodies live as readable files in `tools/pipeline/sources/<name>.js`.

See `docs/anchor-strategy.md` for how to write durable patches that survive Claude version bumps.

## Drift recovery

When Claude releases a new version, anchors may shift. Use:
- `/aio-claude-toolkit:aio-patch-anchor find <fragment>` — find new anchor location
- `docs/drift-recovery.md` — full re-anchoring playbook

